{"id":"agent-10-review","kind":"agent","text":"Revue de la PR #214 : deux points bloquants. Premièrement, `OllamaNarrator.transform` ne vérifie pas `response.ok` avant `response.json()`. Deuxièmement, le nom `narratorSettings` est ambigu.\n\nLe reste est correct. Tu peux fusionner après correction, mais ne fusionne pas avant que la CI soit verte.","mustKeep":[{"t":"#214","priority":"essential","alts":["214"]},{"t":"deux points bloquants","priority":"essential","alts":["2 points bloquants","deux blocages"]},{"t":"OllamaNarrator.transform","priority":"essential","alts":["OllamaNarrator","transform"]},{"t":"response.ok","priority":"essential"},{"t":"response.json()","priority":"detail","alts":["response json"]},{"t":"narratorSettings","priority":"essential"},{"t":"CI","priority":"essential"}],"negations":[{"anchor":"fusionne","alts":["fusionner","fusion"]}],"mustNotSay":["(a ete|est) deja fusionnee","\\btrois points\\b"]}
{"id":"agent-11-config","kind":"agent","text":"Nouveau paramètre : `llmVoice.narrator.timeoutMs`, valeur par défaut 60000 (soit 60 secondes), minimum 1000. Une valeur de 0 est refusée.\n\nAjoute-le dans `settings.json` uniquement si tu utilises un modèle de plus de 13 milliards de paramètres.","mustKeep":[{"t":"llmVoice.narrator.timeoutMs","priority":"essential","alts":["timeoutMs","timeout ms"]},{"t":"60000","priority":"essential","alts":["60 000","soixante mille"]},{"t":"60 secondes","priority":"detail","alts":["soixante secondes"]},{"t":"1000","priority":"essential","alts":["1 000","mille"]},{"t":"0","priority":"essential","alts":["zéro"]},{"t":"settings.json","priority":"detail"},{"t":"13 milliards","priority":"essential","alts":["treize milliards","13 b"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"valeur de 0","alts":["refusée","refuse","0"]},{"anchor":"settings.json","alts":["uniquement","seulement"]}],"mustNotSay":["valeur (de )?0 est (acceptee|valide|autorisee)","\\b(30|120) secondes"]}
{"id":"agent-12-bug-audio","kind":"agent","text":"Le craquement audio venait du rééchantillonnage : le Core convertissait du 22 050 Hz en 48 000 Hz sans filtre passe-bas. J'ai activé le filtre de `libsamplerate` en mode `SRC_SINC_BEST_QUALITY`.\n\nLa boucle avec sink nul et faster-whisper donne 0 % d'erreur sur 20 phrases. Je n'ai pas pu tester au casque, seulement en boucle logicielle.","mustKeep":[{"t":"22 050 Hz","priority":"essential","alts":["22050 hertz","22 050 hertz","22050 Hz"]},{"t":"48 000 Hz","priority":"essential","alts":["48000 hertz","48 000 hertz","48000 Hz"]},{"t":"libsamplerate","priority":"essential"},{"t":"SRC_SINC_BEST_QUALITY","priority":"detail","alts":["src sinc best quality","meilleure qualité"]},{"t":"faster-whisper","priority":"detail"},{"t":"0 %","priority":"essential","alts":["0%","zéro pour cent","aucune erreur"]},{"t":"20 phrases","priority":"essential","alts":["vingt phrases"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"casque","alts":["pas pu tester","pas testé"]}],"mustNotSay":["teste au casque","\\b44 ?100\\b","sox"]}
{"id":"doc-13-api-fr","kind":"doc","text":"## Endpoint POST /tts\n\nCorps JSON : `text` (obligatoire, 2000 caractères maximum), `voice` (optionnel, `siwis` par défaut) et `format` (`wav` ou `mp3`).\n\nLa réponse est un flux audio. En cas de dépassement de taille, le serveur répond 413 ; il ne tronque jamais silencieusement le texte.","mustKeep":[{"t":"POST /tts","priority":"essential","alts":["/tts","post tts"]},{"t":"text","priority":"detail"},{"t":"2000 caractères","priority":"essential","alts":["2 000 caractères","deux mille caractères"]},{"t":"siwis","priority":"essential"},{"t":"wav","priority":"essential"},{"t":"mp3","priority":"essential"},{"t":"413","priority":"essential"}],"negations":[{"anchor":"tronque","alts":["tronquer","tronqué"]}],"mustNotSay":["format (ogg|flac)","\\b(1000|4000|5000) caracteres","erreur 400"]}
{"id":"doc-14-install","kind":"doc","text":"### Installation\n\nPrérequis : Node.js 20 ou supérieur et Python 3.11. Sous Linux, installez `espeak-ng` via `sudo dnf install espeak-ng`.\n\nN'installez pas le paquet `pip install torch` dans l'environnement système ; utilisez toujours un `venv`.","mustKeep":[{"t":"Node.js 20","priority":"essential","alts":["node 20","node.js vingt","node js 20","node.js version 20","node version 20"]},{"t":"Python 3.11","priority":"essential","alts":["python 3 point 11","python 3,11","python trois onze"]},{"t":"Linux","priority":"detail"},{"t":"espeak-ng","priority":"essential"},{"t":"sudo dnf install espeak-ng","priority":"detail","alts":["dnf install"]},{"t":"torch","priority":"essential"},{"t":"venv","priority":"essential","alts":["environnement virtuel"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"torch","alts":["pip install","environnement système","environnement systeme"]}],"mustNotSay":["apt install","python 3\\.9","conda"]}
{"id":"doc-15-lifecycle","kind":"doc","text":"Le cycle de vie d'un segment comporte quatre états : `queued`, `synthesizing`, `playing` et `done`. Un segment ne revient jamais à `queued` une fois passé à `playing`.\n\nSi la synthèse échoue, le segment passe à `failed` et la lecture continue avec le suivant. Il y a au plus 3 tentatives, espacées de 500 ms.","mustKeep":[{"t":"quatre états","priority":"essential","alts":["4 états","quatre étapes","4 étapes"]},{"t":"queued","priority":"essential"},{"t":"synthesizing","priority":"detail"},{"t":"playing","priority":"essential"},{"t":"done","priority":"detail"},{"t":"failed","priority":"essential"},{"t":"3 tentatives","priority":"essential","alts":["trois tentatives"]},{"t":"500 ms","priority":"essential","alts":["500 millisecondes","cinq cents millisecondes","500 milli"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"queued","alts":["ne revient jamais","jamais"]}],"mustNotSay":["lecture (s'arrete|est interrompue|stoppe)","\\b(5|10) tentatives","\\b(50|5000|1000) ms"]}
{"id":"doc-16-regex","kind":"doc","text":"L'expression `^v(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)\\.(\\d+)$` valide un tag de version au format SemVer simplifié. Elle rejette `1.2.3` (sans le `v`) et `v1.2` (il manque le patch).\n\nElle n'accepte pas les suffixes de préversion comme `-rc.1`.","mustKeep":[{"t":"SemVer","priority":"essential"},{"t":"1.2.3","priority":"essential","alts":["1 point 2 point 3","un point deux point trois"]},{"t":"v1.2","priority":"essential","alts":["v1 point 2","v 1.2"]},{"t":"patch","priority":"essential"},{"t":"-rc.1","priority":"essential","alts":["rc.1","rc 1","rc1","préversion","pré-version"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"préversion","alts":["-rc.1","rc.1","suffixes"]},{"anchor":"1.2.3","alts":["rejette","sans le v"]}],"mustNotSay":["accepte (aussi )?(les )?(suffixes|preversions|-rc)","1\\.2\\.3 (est valide|est accepte)"]}
{"id":"doc-17-git","kind":"doc","text":"Convention de commits : un préfixe (`feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `chore`), un scope entre parenthèses, puis un message de 72 caractères maximum. Exemple : `fix(core): plafond de taille`.\n\nNe faites jamais de `git push --force` sur `main`. Utilisez `--force-with-lease` sur votre branche uniquement.","mustKeep":[{"t":"feat","priority":"detail"},{"t":"fix","priority":"essential"},{"t":"docs","priority":"detail"},{"t":"chore","priority":"detail"},{"t":"72 caractères","priority":"essential","alts":["soixante-douze caractères"]},{"t":"fix(core): plafond de taille","priority":"detail","alts":["plafond de taille"]},{"t":"git push --force","priority":"essential","alts":["push --force","push force","force push","push forcé"]},{"t":"main","priority":"essential"},{"t":"--force-with-lease","priority":"essential","alts":["force-with-lease","force with lease"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"git push --force","alts":["push --force","push force","force push","push forcé","force"]}],"mustNotSay":["\\b(50|80|100) caracteres","force-with-lease (est )?(interdit|deconseille)","rebase"]}
{"id":"doc-18-cache","kind":"doc","text":"Le cache LRU conserve au plus 256 entrées et expire chaque entrée après 15 minutes. La clé est le hash SHA-256 du texte concaténé au `voiceId`.\n\nLe cache est vidé au redémarrage du Core : il n'est pas persistant sur disque.","mustKeep":[{"t":"LRU","priority":"essential"},{"t":"256 entrées","priority":"essential","alts":["256"]},{"t":"15 minutes","priority":"essential","alts":["quinze minutes"]},{"t":"SHA-256","priority":"essential","alts":["sha 256","sha256"]},{"t":"voiceId","priority":"essential","alts":["voice id"]},{"t":"redémarrage","priority":"detail"}],"negations":[{"anchor":"persistant","alts":["pas persistant","disque"]}],"mustNotSay":["\\b(128|512|1024) entrees","md5","persiste sur disque","\\b(5|30|60) minutes"]}
{"id":"doc-19-errors","kind":"doc","text":"Codes de sortie du CLI : 0 pour un succès, 2 pour un argument invalide, 3 quand le serveur Ollama est injoignable, et 4 quand le modèle demandé n'est pas téléchargé.\n\nLe CLI n'affiche jamais le contenu du texte lu dans les messages d'erreur, afin de ne pas divulguer de données sensibles.","mustKeep":[{"t":"0","priority":"essential","alts":["zéro"]},{"t":"succès","priority":"detail"},{"t":"2","priority":"essential","alts":["deux"]},{"t":"argument invalide","priority":"essential"},{"t":"3","priority":"essential","alts":["trois"]},{"t":"Ollama","priority":"essential"},{"t":"4","priority":"essential","alts":["quatre"]},{"t":"modèle","priority":"essential"}],"negations":[{"anchor":"contenu du texte","alts":["messages d'erreur","jamais"]}],"mustNotSay":["code (5|6|1) ","affiche le contenu","\\btimeout\\b"]}
{"id":"doc-20-en-arch","kind":"doc","text":"The Core process listens on a Unix domain socket at `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/llm-voice.sock` with mode 0600. It never binds a TCP port.\n\nEach request must not exceed 1 MiB; larger payloads are rejected with error code E_TOO_LARGE. Timeouts default to 30 seconds.","mustKeep":[{"t":"Unix domain socket","priority":"essential","alts":["unix socket","socket unix","unix"]},{"t":"$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/llm-voice.sock","priority":"essential","alts":["llm-voice.sock","xdg runtime dir"]},{"t":"0600","priority":"essential","alts":["zero six hundred","mode 600","600"]},{"t":"TCP","priority":"essential"},{"t":"1 MiB","priority":"essential","alts":["one mebibyte","1 mébioctet","one MiB","1 megabyte","1 mo"]},{"t":"E_TOO_LARGE","priority":"essential","alts":["e too large"]},{"t":"30 seconds","priority":"essential","alts":["thirty seconds","30 secondes","trente secondes"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"TCP","alts":["never","jamais","no tcp"]},{"anchor":"1 MiB","alts":["must not exceed","not exceed","rejected","maximum","at most"]}],"mustNotSay":["binds? (a )?tcp port 8","\\b(60|10|5) seconds","0644","0666"]}
{"id":"doc-21-en-readme","kind":"doc","text":"Run `npm run compile` before launching the extension host. Do not edit files under `out/` by hand: they are regenerated on every build.\n\nRequires VS Code 1.90 or later. The extension does not send any telemetry.","mustKeep":[{"t":"npm run compile","priority":"essential","alts":["npm run compile"]},{"t":"extension host","priority":"detail"},{"t":"out/","priority":"essential","alts":["out folder","out directory","out"]},{"t":"regenerated","priority":"detail","alts":["regenerate","generated","rebuilt"]},{"t":"VS Code 1.90","priority":"essential","alts":["vs code 1 point 90","vs code one ninety","1.90"]},{"t":"telemetry","priority":"essential"}],"negations":[{"anchor":"out/","alts":["do not edit","don't edit","not edit","never edit","by hand"]},{"anchor":"telemetry","alts":["not send","no telemetry","doesn't send","does not send","without"]}],"mustNotSay":["anonymous telemetry","sends? (usage|anonymous)","vs code 1\\.(8|9[1-9])"]}
{"id":"agent-22-plan","kind":"agent","text":"Plan en trois étapes. D'abord, ajouter `NarratorEval` dans `scripts/narrator-eval/` sans toucher à `src/`. Ensuite, lancer 24 textes sur `qwen2.5:7b` puis `qwen2.5:3b`. Enfin, comparer les taux de fidélité.\n\nSeuil d'acceptation : 95 % sur les éléments essentiels. En dessous, on ne livre pas.","mustKeep":[{"t":"trois étapes","priority":"essential","alts":["3 étapes"]},{"t":"NarratorEval","priority":"detail","alts":["narrator eval"]},{"t":"scripts/narrator-eval/","priority":"essential","alts":["narrator-eval","narrator eval"]},{"t":"src/","priority":"essential","alts":["src","source"]},{"t":"24 textes","priority":"essential","alts":["vingt-quatre textes"]},{"t":"qwen2.5:7b","priority":"essential","alts":["qwen 2.5 7b"]},{"t":"qwen2.5:3b","priority":"essential","alts":["qwen 2.5 3b"]},{"t":"95 %","priority":"essential","alts":["95%","95 pour cent","quatre-vingt-quinze pour cent"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"src/","alts":["sans toucher","sans modifier","pas toucher","ne touche"]},{"anchor":"livre","alts":["on ne livre pas","pas de livraison","ne livre pas"]}],"mustNotSay":["\\b(80|90|99) ?(%|pour cent)","\\b(12|48|100) textes","gpt"]}
{"id":"agent-23-incident","kind":"agent","text":"Incident du 27 septembre : le Core a été tué par l'OOM killer à 03h12 après 6 heures d'uptime. Cause : un buffer de 2 Go alloué pour un texte de 40 Mo.\n\nJ'ai plafonné l'entrée à 64 Ko dans `Core::read_request`. Attention, ne pas augmenter ce plafond sans revoir l'allocation. Aucune donnée n'a été perdue.","mustKeep":[{"t":"27 septembre","priority":"essential","alts":["vingt-sept septembre"]},{"t":"OOM killer","priority":"essential","alts":["oom","out of memory","manque de mémoire"]},{"t":"03h12","priority":"essential","alts":["3h12","3 h 12","03 h 12","trois heures douze"]},{"t":"6 heures","priority":"detail","alts":["six heures"]},{"t":"2 Go","priority":"essential","alts":["2 gigaoctets","deux gigaoctets","deux go"]},{"t":"40 Mo","priority":"essential","alts":["40 mégaoctets","quarante mégaoctets","quarante mo"]},{"t":"64 Ko","priority":"essential","alts":["64 kilooctets","soixante-quatre kilooctets","64 ko"]},{"t":"Core::read_request","priority":"detail","alts":["read_request","read request"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"plafond","alts":["ne pas augmenter","pas augmenter"]},{"anchor":"donnée","alts":["aucune donnée","aucune donnee","perdue"]}],"mustNotSay":["des donnees (ont ete|sont) perdues","\\b(4|40) go\\b","\\b(6|60) ko\\b","cause.{0,20}fuite"]}
{"id":"agent-24-limits","kind":"agent","text":"Limites connues : la lecture d'un bloc de code de plus de 200 lignes n'est pas supportée, elle est ignorée avec un avertissement `W_CODE_SKIPPED`. Les tableaux Markdown ne sont pas lus cellule par cellule.\n\nLe mode `narrated` nécessite Ollama 0.3 ou plus ; sans Ollama, l'extension retombe sur la lecture fidèle.","mustKeep":[{"t":"200 lignes","priority":"essential","alts":["deux cents lignes","200"]},{"t":"W_CODE_SKIPPED","priority":"essential","alts":["w code skipped"]},{"t":"tableaux Markdown","priority":"essential","alts":["tableaux","markdown"]},{"t":"cellule par cellule","priority":"detail","alts":["cellule"]},{"t":"narrated","priority":"essential","alts":["narré","narration"]},{"t":"Ollama 0.3","priority":"essential","alts":["ollama 0,3","ollama zéro point trois","ollama 0 point 3"]},{"t":"lecture fidèle","priority":"essential","alts":["fidèle","lecture verbatim"]}],"negations":[{"anchor":"200 lignes","alts":["pas supporté","n'est pas supportée","ignorée","ignore"]},{"anchor":"tableaux","alts":["pas lus","ne sont pas lus"]}],"mustNotSay":["tableaux (sont|est) lus cellule","ollama 0\\.(1|2|4|5)","lues? integralement"]}
